tasks.description:
Using the customs regulations research and reviewed transaction data, prepare a complete Commercial Invoice in both English and Traditional Chinese (bilingual format).

COMMERCIAL INVOICE MANDATORY FIELDS:
1. Invoice number and date
2. Seller (exporter) full name, address, registration number, tax ID, contact person title and name, phone, email, authorized representative name and title
3. Buyer (importer) full name, address, registration number, tax ID, contact person title and name, phone, email, authorized representative name and title
4. Country of origin / Place of production: {place_of_production}
5. Country of final destination
6. Port of discharge: {port_of_discharge}
7. HS Code and goods description
8. Product name and specifications
9. Quantity, unit of measure, unit price, and total price
10. Currency of transaction
11. Incoterm and named place
12. Payment terms and method
13. Marks and numbers on packages
14. Packaging details
15. Delivery terms and estimated shipment date
16. Trademark owner information (if applicable)
17. Certification statement
18. Authorized signature block (authorized representative name and title)

DEFAULT VALUES \ apply when the input is blank; insert directly, do NOT mark REQUIRES COMPLETION:
- Invoice number: INV-[YYYYMMDD]-001 (use today's date)
- Payment timing: if blank \ T/T 30% deposit before production, 70% balance before shipment
- Certification statement: "We hereby certify that the information on this invoice is true, correct and complete."

REQUIRES COMPLETION \ only mark these when not provided:
- Exporter / importer names, addresses, registration numbers, tax IDs, contact details, authorized representatives
- Product name, description, quantity, unit, unit price, total price, currency
- HS Code, Incoterm and named place, port of discharge, place of production
- Delivery date, bank details, marks and numbers

=== CUSTOMS REGULATIONS ===
{customs_research}

=== DATA REVIEW FINDINGS ===
{data_review}

=== TRANSACTION DATA ===
Exporter: {exporter_name}, {exporter_address} | Reg No: {exporter_reg_no} | Tax ID: {exporter_tax_id} | Contact: {exporter_contact_title} | Tel: {exporter_phone} | Email: {exporter_email} | Authorized Rep: {exporter_auth_rep} | Rep Title: {exporter_auth_rep_title}
Importer: {importer_name}, {importer_address} | Reg No: {importer_reg_no} | Tax ID: {importer_tax_id} | Contact: {importer_contact_title} | Tel: {importer_phone} | Email: {importer_email} | Authorized Rep: {importer_auth_rep} | Rep Title: {importer_auth_rep_title}
Product: {product_name} | Description: {product_description} | Qty: {product_qty} | Specs: {product_specs} | Packaging: {product_packaging} | Unit Price: {unit_price} | Total: {total_price} | Currency: {currency}
HS Code: {hs_code} | Incoterm: {incoterm} | Payment: {payment_method} | Payment Timing: {payment_timing} | Bank Details: {bank_details}
Place of Production: {place_of_production} | Port of Discharge: {port_of_discharge}
Production Date: {production_date} | Delivery Date: {delivery_date}
Trademark Owner: {trademark_owner} | Trademark Owner Contact: {trademark_owner_contact} | Usage Terms: {trademark_usage}
Additional Obligations: {additional_obligations}
Other Remarks: {other_remarks}

