Expected output: A detailed data review report listing: (1) missing or incomplete fields with specific instructions for what information is needed, (2) inconsistency flags with explanations, (3) compliance gaps versus customs requirements, (4) optimization recommendations, and (5) a final verdict of READY FOR DOCUMENT GENERATION or NEEDS CORRECTION with a prioritized list of required corrections.

